 "translation": "The society that does not accept these innocent and blameless women, that does not adopt them, is a rotten society and should be destroyed. He would urge that these women be settled in homes and inspire them to be given the same status that is given to any woman, any mother, daughter, sister, or wife in a home. Then he would say that they should not even be reminded of the things that happened to them, even by hints and allusions, because their hearts are wounded. They are delicate, like touch-me-nots; if you even touch them, they will wither.",
